			"id": "how-to-use",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Start here\n\nThis is a **starter diagram** — replace every node below with your own.\n\nThe graph view shows *that* things are connected. This canvas shows *how*: each arrow carries a label naming the actual pathway.\n\n**To use it:** delete these example nodes, then drag notes in from `estate/products/` and `estate/accounts/` (Obsidian: drag from the file list onto the canvas). Draw an arrow between two nodes and give it a verb — \"deploys into\", \"ships logs to\", \"reads donations from\".\n\nThis is [JSON Canvas](https://jsoncanvas.org), an open format — plain JSON in your repository, readable without Obsidian.",
